OL,3,AJohn Simpson: Ukraine is bowed but     
OL,4,Astill unbroken as freezing weather sets
OL,5,Ain                                     
OL,7,FJohn Simpson: Ukraine is bowed but     
OL,8,Fstill unbroken as freezing weather sets
OL,9,Fin                                     
OL,11,FSomething weird happens when you reach 
OL,12,FKyiv after the eight-hour drive from   
OL,13,Fthe Polish border: the clock on your   
OL,14,Fmobile phone goes to midnight. It's not
OL,15,Freally for phones - it seems to be part
OL,16,Fof a wider strategy to disorient the   
OL,17,Fmissiles and drones the Russians are   
OL,18,Fsending over.                          
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3 
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
