OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 312 Fri 27 NovC16:56/04
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws                 
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AJohn Simpson: Ukraine is bowed but     
OL,4,Astill unbroken as freezing weather sets
OL,5,Ain                                     
OL,7,FAside from little things like that,    
OL,8,Fthough, Kyiv seems fairly normal at    
OL,9,Ffirst sight. You become well aware     
OL,10,Fthere's a war on when sirens begin to  
OL,11,Fwail and people check their phones for 
OL,12,Fthe notifications which tell them      
OL,13,Fthere's a red alert and missiles are on
OL,14,Ftheir way. You can even buy gadgets    
OL,15,Fthat show you which direction the      
OL,16,Fdrones are coming from, and what type  
OL,17,Fthey are.                              
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3 
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
PN,31203
SC,0003
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 312 Fri 27 NovC16:56/04
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws                 
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AJohn Simpson: Ukraine is bowed but     
OL,4,Astill unbroken as freezing weather sets
OL,5,Ain                                     
OL,7,FThe drones and ballistic missiles have 
OL,8,Fbeen hitting in sizeable numbers over  
OL,9,Fthe last couple of weeks. On the       
OL,10,Fmorning of Monday 16 November, the     
OL,11,Fbattle of the bridges began. Ukraine   
OL,12,Fhit the Kerch bridge which links Russia
OL,13,Fto illegally occupied Crimea. Then it  
OL,14,Flaunched a bigger wave of missiles and 
OL,15,Fdrones, damaging the central           
OL,16,Froad-bridge arch. A few hours later,   
OL,17,Fpresumably in revenge, Russia fired    
OL,18,Fseven ballistic missiles at Kyiv,      
OL,19,Fdisabling two of the nine bridges that 
OL,20,Fcross the River Dnipro.                
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/3 
